##### LESPOKEMONS

### http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon#bulbasaur
:bulbasaur rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                             :Pokemon ;
                    :BelongsToEggGroup :monster, :plant ;
